{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cg72rj2CFJEy4SivrHzvv","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"In Claude skills, the `description` field in the SKILL.md frontmatter has these limits:\n\n- **Maximum length:** 1,024 characters. It must be non-empty and can't contain XML tags.\n- **`name`:** up to 64 characters, using lowercase letters, numbers, and hyphens.\n\nClaude loads every skill's name and description into its context at startup and uses them to decide when to trigger the skill. So even within the limit, shorter is better. Say what the skill does and when to use it, with concrete trigger phrases. Claude Code may also shorten very long descriptions in the skill listing when many skills are installed.\n\nThese figures are from my memory of the Agent Skills spec, and I haven't checked them against the current docs. If the exact number matters, I can look it up."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6835,"cache_read_input_tokens":11227,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6835},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6be2e6d9-117d-46e2-a971-024dfa9abefd","uuid":"6a085a49-6084-4a21-b48b-b9fe41207a5a","timestamp":"2026-10-17T02:37:51.581Z","request_id":"req_011Cg72rijL8spkKN153TBjH"}
